{"c":[{"name":"20260826T134339Z-d618aad7ad08508d","text":"Cursor skill Path lines use Windows backslashes; warehouse keeps \\.cursor; dashboard markdown-it collapses \\. so .cursor glues to the parent dir.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260826T134816Z-efbe5193e7203f0e","text":"Dashboard JSON export serializes full session_detail; API payload additions automatically change exported JSON unless filtered.","type":"note"}]}
